# Deliberately NOT ignored: pyproject.toml, poetry.lock, README.md, LICENSE.
# The image builds the package wheel from this tree, and those files are build
# inputs (metadata, pinned dependencies, long_description, license text).
# Ignoring them made the Docker build unable to construct a wheel at all.
